      "label": "Dalai Lama delivering a speech or statement",
      "description": "The Dalai Lama is seated and gesturing with his hands while speaking, appearing engaged in a public address or interview. The background includes a banner with logos and text, indicating a formal or institutional setting. The text overlay on the image adds a humorous or satirical context to his speech.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
